    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the medical thing but it doesnt feel like a \"condition\"... it feels too purposeful. like my brain is finally tuning into frequencies that were always there but i was just blind to them. the heat signatures and the electrical hum, they have a pattern to them. it's not just random noise. if this is a transition period, shouldn't there be a way to stabilize my focus so i don't lose control of it? is there like a protocol to help manage these new inputs while my brain adjusts?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
